{"real": false, "dur": 103.18, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 5.02, "text": "Now, you might be thinking: so learners never come across anything new?", "words": [{"w": "Now,", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "you", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "might", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "be", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "thinking:", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "so", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "learners", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "never", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "come", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "across", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "anything", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "new?", "s": 4.63}]}, {"start": 5.37, "end": 6.13, "text": "They do.", "words": [{"w": "They", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "do.", "s": 5.75}]}, {"start": 6.48, "end": 9.56, "text": "The French approach I follow is a spiral.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 6.48}, {"w": "French", "s": 6.87}, {"w": "approach", "s": 7.25}, {"w": "I", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "follow", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "is", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "a", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "spiral.", "s": 9.18}]}, {"start": 9.91, "end": 15.3, "text": "Learners meet things early, as whole phrases, and figure out how they work later.", "words": [{"w": "Learners", "s": 9.91}, {"w": "meet", "s": 10.3}, {"w": "things", "s": 10.68}, {"w": "early,", "s": 11.07}, {"w": "as", "s": 11.45}, {"w": "whole", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "phrases,", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "and", "s": 12.6}, {"w": "figure", "s": 12.99}, {"w": "out", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "how", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "they", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "work", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "later.", "s": 14.91}]}, {"start": 15.65, "end": 19.11, "text": "So I’ve divided what learners encounter into three categories.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 15.65}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 16.03}, {"w": "divided", "s": 16.42}, {"w": "what", "s": 16.8}, {"w": "learners", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "into", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "three", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "categories.", "s": 18.72}]}, {"start": 19.46, "end": 26.77, "text": "Seen means learners come across a phrase, but they don’t have to study it or get tested on it.", "words": [{"w": "Seen", "s": 19.46}, {"w": "means", "s": 19.84}, {"w": "learners", "s": 20.23}, {"w": "come", "s": 20.61}, {"w": "across", "s": 21.0}, {"w": "a", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "phrase,", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "but", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "they", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "don’t", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "have", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "to", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "study", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "it", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "or", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "get", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "tested", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "on", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "it.", "s": 26.38}]}, {"start": 27.12, "end": 31.73, "text": "Focus means it’s time to learn it properly, with explanations and practice.", "words": [{"w": "Focus", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "means", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "time", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "to", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "learn", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "it", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "properly,", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "with", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "explanations", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "and", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "practice.", "s": 31.35}]}, {"start": 32.08, "end": 39.0, "text": "And Scored means learners can now be tested on it, but only once the course has taught it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 32.08}, {"w": "Scored", "s": 32.47}, {"w": "means", "s": 32.85}, {"w": "learners", "s": 33.23}, {"w": "can", "s": 33.62}, {"w": "now", "s": 34.0}, {"w": "be", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "tested", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "on", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "it,", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "but", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "only", "s": 36.31}, {"w": "once", "s": 36.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "course", "s": 37.47}, {"w": "has", "s": 37.85}, {"w": "taught", "s": 38.23}, {"w": "it.", "s": 38.62}]}, {"start": 39.35, "end": 40.89, "text": "Think of a camera.", "words": [{"w": "Think", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "of", "s": 39.74}, {"w": "a", "s": 40.12}, {"w": "camera.", "s": 40.51}]}, {"start": 41.24, "end": 44.32, "text": "Something can be in the shot but blurry.", "words": [{"w": "Something", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "can", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "be", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "in", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 42.78}, {"w": "shot", "s": 43.17}, {"w": "but", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "blurry.", "s": 43.93}]}, {"start": 44.67, "end": 45.44, "text": "That’s Seen.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 44.67}, {"w": "Seen.", "s": 45.05}]}, {"start": 45.79, "end": 48.1, "text": "Then you bring it into focus.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 45.79}, {"w": "you", "s": 46.17}, {"w": "bring", "s": 46.56}, {"w": "it", "s": 46.94}, {"w": "into", "s": 47.33}, {"w": "focus.", "s": 47.71}]}, {"start": 48.45, "end": 49.22, "text": "That’s Focus.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 48.45}, {"w": "Focus.", "s": 48.83}]}, {"start": 49.57, "end": 52.64, "text": "And only then do you take the picture.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 49.57}, {"w": "only", "s": 49.95}, {"w": "then", "s": 50.33}, {"w": "do", "s": 50.72}, {"w": "you", "s": 51.1}, {"w": "take", "s": 51.49}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.87}, {"w": "picture.", "s": 52.26}]}, {"start": 52.99, "end": 53.76, "text": "That’s Scored.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 52.99}, {"w": "Scored.", "s": 53.38}]}, {"start": 54.11, "end": 62.96, "text": "For example, learners meet “I was born in” before studying the past tense, and “How are you?” before learning the verb “to go.”", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 54.11}, {"w": "example,", "s": 54.5}, {"w": "learners", "s": 54.88}, {"w": "meet", "s": 55.27}, {"w": "“I", "s": 55.65}, {"w": "was", "s": 56.03}, {"w": "born", "s": 56.42}, {"w": "in”", "s": 56.8}, {"w": "before", "s": 57.19}, {"w": "studying", "s": 57.57}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.96}, {"w": "past", "s": 58.34}, {"w": "tense,", "s": 58.73}, {"w": "and", "s": 59.11}, {"w": "“How", "s": 59.5}, {"w": "are", "s": 59.88}, {"w": "you?”", "s": 60.27}, {"w": "before", "s": 60.65}, {"w": "learning", "s": 61.03}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.42}, {"w": "verb", "s": 61.8}, {"w": "“to", "s": 62.19}, {"w": "go.”", "s": 62.57}]}, {"start": 63.31, "end": 67.15, "text": "I also allow a little unfamiliar language, roughly twenty percent.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 63.31}, {"w": "also", "s": 63.69}, {"w": "allow", "s": 64.08}, {"w": "a", "s": 64.46}, {"w": "little", "s": 64.85}, {"w": "unfamiliar", "s": 65.23}, {"w": "language,", "s": 65.62}, {"w": "roughly", "s": 66.0}, {"w": "twenty", "s": 66.38}, {"w": "percent.", "s": 66.77}]}, {"start": 67.5, "end": 69.81, "text": "People learn by struggling a bit.", "words": [{"w": "People", "s": 67.5}, {"w": "learn", "s": 67.89}, {"w": "by", "s": 68.27}, {"w": "struggling", "s": 68.66}, {"w": "a", "s": 69.04}, {"w": "bit.", "s": 69.43}]}, {"start": 70.16, "end": 72.47, "text": "If everything’s familiar, it’s too easy.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 70.16}, {"w": "everything’s", "s": 70.55}, {"w": "familiar,", "s": 70.93}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 71.32}, {"w": "too", "s": 71.7}, {"w": "easy.", "s": 72.08}]}, {"start": 72.82, "end": 76.28, "text": "If half of it is unknown, it’s too hard.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 72.82}, {"w": "half", "s": 73.2}, {"w": "of", "s": 73.59}, {"w": "it", "s": 73.97}, {"w": "is", "s": 74.36}, {"w": "unknown,", "s": 74.74}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 75.13}, {"w": "too", "s": 75.51}, {"w": "hard.", "s": 75.9}]}, {"start": 76.63, "end": 81.63, "text": "But learners should never need that unfamiliar language to get the answer right.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 76.63}, {"w": "learners", "s": 77.02}, {"w": "should", "s": 77.4}, {"w": "never", "s": 77.78}, {"w": "need", "s": 78.17}, {"w": "that", "s": 78.55}, {"w": "unfamiliar", "s": 78.94}, {"w": "language", "s": 79.32}, {"w": "to", "s": 79.71}, {"w": "get", "s": 80.09}, {"w": "the", "s": 80.48}, {"w": "answer", "s": 80.86}, {"w": "right.", "s": 81.25}]}, {"start": 81.98, "end": 86.21, "text": "Look at the first sentence: “At weekends, I go … skiing.”", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 81.98}, {"w": "at", "s": 82.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 82.75}, {"w": "first", "s": 83.13}, {"w": "sentence:", "s": 83.52}, {"w": "“At", "s": 83.9}, {"w": "weekends,", "s": 84.29}, {"w": "I", "s": 84.67}, {"w": "go", "s": 85.06}, {"w": "…", "s": 85.44}, {"w": "skiing.”", "s": 85.83}]}, {"start": 86.56, "end": 92.33, "text": "The answer is the word for “some,” so it doesn’t matter that “weekend” is new.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 86.56}, {"w": "answer", "s": 86.95}, {"w": "is", "s": 87.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 87.72}, {"w": "word", "s": 88.1}, {"w": "for", "s": 88.48}, {"w": "“some,”", "s": 88.87}, {"w": "so", "s": 89.25}, {"w": "it", "s": 89.64}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 90.02}, {"w": "matter", "s": 90.41}, {"w": "that", "s": 90.79}, {"w": "“weekend”", "s": 91.18}, {"w": "is", "s": 91.56}, {"w": "new.", "s": 91.95}]}, {"start": 92.68, "end": 95.76, "text": "The second one says “It is two …”", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 92.68}, {"w": "second", "s": 93.07}, {"w": "one", "s": 93.45}, {"w": "says", "s": 93.83}, {"w": "“It", "s": 94.22}, {"w": "is", "s": 94.6}, {"w": "two", "s": 94.99}, {"w": "…”", "s": 95.37}]}, {"start": 96.11, "end": 100.34, "text": "There the answer would be “half past,” which is never taught.", "words": [{"w": "There", "s": 96.11}, {"w": "the", "s": 96.49}, {"w": "answer", "s": 96.88}, {"w": "would", "s": 97.26}, {"w": "be", "s": 97.65}, {"w": "“half", "s": 98.03}, {"w": "past,”", "s": 98.42}, {"w": "which", "s": 98.8}, {"w": "is", "s": 99.18}, {"w": "never", "s": 99.57}, {"w": "taught.", "s": 99.95}]}, {"start": 100.69, "end": 102.23, "text": "So that one’s out.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 100.69}, {"w": "that", "s": 101.07}, {"w": "one’s", "s": 101.46}, {"w": "out.", "s": 101.84}]}]}